#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:2
msgid "lmcache coordinator"
msgstr "lmcache coordinator"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``lmcache coordinator`` command launches the LMCache MP "
"**coordinator**, a standalone HTTP service that tracks the MP server "
"instances in a deployment. MP servers register with it and send periodic "
"heartbeats; the coordinator evicts any instance whose heartbeat lapses "
"past ``--instance-timeout``."
msgstr ""
"``lmcache coordinator`` 命令启动 LMCache MP **协调器**\\ ，这是一个独立的 HTTP "
"服务，用于跟踪部署中的 MP 服务器实例。MP 服务器向其注册并发送定期心跳；协调器会逐出任何心跳超时的实例，该超时时间由 "
"``--instance-timeout`` 指定。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:9
msgid ""
"It is the preferred form of ``python -m lmcache.v1.mp_coordinator``, "
"which still works and accepts the same flags. The process runs in the "
"foreground; stop it with ``Ctrl-C``."
msgstr "它是 ``python -m lmcache.v1.mp_coordinator`` 的首选形式，该命令仍然有效并接受相同的标志。该进程在前台运行；使用 ``Ctrl-C`` 停止它。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:18
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:28
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:34
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "标志"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:35
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:36
msgid "``--host HOST``"
msgstr "``--host HOST``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:37
msgid "Bind address for the coordinator's HTTP server (default: ``0.0.0.0``)."
msgstr "协调器 HTTP 服务器的绑定地址（默认：\\ ``0.0.0.0``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:38
msgid "``--port PORT``"
msgstr "``--port PORT``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:39
msgid "HTTP port (default: ``9300``)."
msgstr "HTTP 端口（默认值：\\ ``9300``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:40
msgid "``--instance-timeout SECS``"
msgstr "``--instance-timeout SECS``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:41
msgid ""
"Seconds without a heartbeat after which an instance is evicted (default: "
"``30``)."
msgstr "在没有心跳的情况下，经过多少秒后实例被逐出（默认值：\\ ``30``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:43
msgid "``--health-check-interval SECS``"
msgstr "``--health-check-interval SECS``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:44
msgid ""
"Seconds between health-check sweeps; ``0`` disables the loop (default: "
"``10``)."
msgstr "健康检查扫描之间的秒数；\\ ``0`` 禁用循环（默认值：\\ ``10``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:46
msgid "``--eviction-check-interval SECS``"
msgstr "``--eviction-check-interval SECS``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:47
msgid ""
"Seconds between L2 eviction sweeps; ``0`` disables the loop (default: "
"``5``)."
msgstr "L2 逐出扫描之间的秒数；\\ ``0`` 禁用循环（默认值：\\ ``5``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:49
msgid "``--eviction-ratio RATIO``"
msgstr "``--eviction-ratio RATIO``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:50
msgid ""
"Fraction of tracked keys (by count) to evict per cycle, ``0.0`` to "
"``1.0`` (default: ``0.2``)."
msgstr "每个周期逐出的跟踪键的比例（按计数），\\ ``0.0`` 到 ``1.0``\\ （默认值：\\ ``0.2``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:52
msgid "``--trigger-watermark RATIO``"
msgstr "``--trigger-watermark RATIO``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:53
msgid ""
"Eviction fires when usage reaches this fraction of the quota, ``0.0`` "
"(exclusive) to ``1.0`` (default: ``1.0``)."
msgstr "当使用量达到配额的这个比例时会触发逐出，\\ ``0.0``\\ （不包括）到\\ ``1.0``\\ （默认值：\\ ``1.0``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:55
msgid "``--chunk-size N``"
msgstr "``--chunk-size N``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:56
msgid ""
"Tokens per KV chunk: the CacheBlend match unit and the unit used to "
"resolve pin ``token_ids`` to keys. Must equal the MP servers' ``--chunk-"
"size`` (default: ``256``)."
msgstr ""
"每个 KV 块的令牌数：CacheBlend 匹配单元以及用于将固定的 ``token_ids`` 解析为键的单元。必须等于 MP 服务器的 "
"``--chunk-size``（默认值：``256``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:59
msgid "``--hash-algorithm NAME``"
msgstr "``--hash-algorithm NAME``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:60
msgid ""
"Token hash algorithm for pin key resolution; must equal the MP servers' "
"``--hash-algorithm``. ``blake3`` (default) is self-contained; other "
"algorithms require vLLM importable in the coordinator."
msgstr ""
"用于固定密钥解析的令牌哈希算法；必须与 MP 服务器的 ``--hash-algorithm`` "
"相等。``blake3``（默认）是自包含的；其他算法需要在协调器中可导入的 vLLM。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:63
msgid "``--enable-blend-lookup``"
msgstr "``--enable-blend-lookup``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:64
msgid ""
"Index stored chunk content so ``POST /directory/blend-lookup`` can serve "
"fleet CacheBlend reuse. Off by default: hashing content costs CPU on "
"every store and is useless without CacheBlend. Also requires the MP "
"servers' ``--coordinator-event-reporting``, which feeds the index."
msgstr "索引存储的块内容，以便 ``POST /directory/blend-lookup`` 可以服务于舰队的 CacheBlend 重用。默认情况下关闭：哈希内容会在每次存储时消耗 CPU，并且在没有 CacheBlend 的情况下毫无用处。还需要 MP 服务器的 ``--coordinator-event-reporting``，该选项用于填充索引。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:68
msgid "``--blend-probe-stride N``"
msgstr "``--blend-probe-stride N``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:69
msgid ""
"Positions between CacheBlend match probes; ``1`` probes every offset for "
"full recall (default: ``1``). Ignored unless blend lookup is on."
msgstr "在 CacheBlend 匹配探针之间的位置；``1`` 在每个偏移量处探测以实现完全回忆（默认值：``1``）。除非启用混合查找，否则将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:71
msgid "``--checkpoint-path FILE``"
msgstr "``--checkpoint-path FILE``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:72
msgid ""
"Checkpoint the coordinator's directory, usage view and stream cursors to "
"this file, so a restart resumes instead of starting cold. Unset disables "
"checkpointing."
msgstr "将协调器的目录、使用视图和流游标检查点保存到此文件，以便重新启动时恢复而不是冷启动。取消设置将禁用检查点功能。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:75
msgid "``--checkpoint-interval SECS``"
msgstr "``--checkpoint-interval SECS``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:76
msgid ""
"Seconds between checkpoint writes; ``0`` writes only on a clean stop "
"(default: ``60``). Ignored unless ``--checkpoint-path`` is set."
msgstr "检查点写入之间的秒数；``0`` 仅在干净停止时写入（默认值：``60``）。除非设置了 ``--checkpoint-path``，否则将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:78
msgid "``--metadata-path FILE``"
msgstr "``--metadata-path FILE``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:79
msgid ""
"Store operator-set state -- L2 pins and per-``cache_salt`` quotas -- in "
"this file, written whenever it changes. Unset means that state is lost on"
" restart."
msgstr "将操作员设置状态（L2 引脚和每个 ``cache_salt`` 配额）存储在此文件中，每当状态发生变化时写入。未设置意味着在重启时状态将丢失。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:82
msgid "``--extra-config JSON``"
msgstr "``--extra-config JSON``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:83
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"JSON object of settings the core flags do not name, read by whichever "
"view or controller looks for them. Lets a new one ship with its own "
"settings without a flag here. The coordinator reads one key itself, "
"``controller_packages``: a list of importable paths to load out-of-tree "
"controllers from, e.g. ``--extra-config '{\"controller_packages\": "
"[\"acme.controllers\"]}'``. Controllers only; views are in-tree."
msgstr "核心标志未命名的设置的 JSON 对象，由查找它们的视图或控制器读取。允许新的控制器使用自己的设置而不需要在此处添加标志。协调器自己读取一个键，``controller_packages``：一个可导入路径的列表，用于加载树外控制器，例如 ``--extra-config '{\\\"controller_packages\\\": [\\\"acme.controllers\\\"]}'``。仅限控制器；视图在树内。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:90
msgid "``--timeout-keep-alive SECS``"
msgstr "``--timeout-keep-alive SECS``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:91
msgid ""
"Seconds the HTTP server keeps idle connections open before closing them. "
"Must be greater than the MP servers' heartbeat interval (default ``5``), "
"otherwise heartbeat requests may hit a closing connection and fail with "
"``Server disconnected without sending a response`` (default: ``10``)."
msgstr "HTTP服务器在关闭空闲连接之前保持连接打开的秒数。必须大于MP服务器的心跳间隔（默认``5``），否则心跳请求可能会遇到关闭的连接并失败，错误信息为``服务器在未发送响应的情况下断开连接``（默认值：``10``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:96
msgid "``--disable-metrics``"
msgstr "``--disable-metrics``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:97
msgid "Disable OpenTelemetry metrics. Metrics are enabled by default."
msgstr "禁用 OpenTelemetry 指标。默认情况下启用指标。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:98
msgid "``--otlp-endpoint URL``"
msgstr "``--otlp-endpoint URL``"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:99
msgid ""
"Push metrics to the specified OTLP gRPC endpoint. When unset, Prometheus "
"pull mode exposes ``/metrics`` on the coordinator HTTP port."
msgstr "将指标推送到指定的 OTLP gRPC 端点。当未设置时，Prometheus 拉取模式会在协调器 HTTP 端口上暴露 ``/metrics``。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:103
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:105
msgid ""
"Every flag is optional; an unset flag keeps the built-in default listed "
"above."
msgstr "每个标志都是可选的；未设置的标志将保留上述列出的内置默认值。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:107
msgid ""
"Prometheus pull mode reuses the coordinator's existing HTTP server; it "
"does not start a second server or reserve a separate Prometheus port. "
"Metrics-disabled and OTLP push modes both return HTTP 404 from the local "
"``/metrics`` route."
msgstr "Prometheus 拉取模式重用协调器现有的 HTTP 服务器；它不会启动第二个服务器或保留单独的 Prometheus 端口。禁用指标和 OTLP 推送模式都会从本地 ``/metrics`` 路由返回 HTTP 404。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:111
msgid "See :doc:`/mp/coordinator` for the active eviction loop."
msgstr "请参阅 :doc:`/mp/coordinator` 以获取活动逐出循环的信息。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:113
msgid ""
"The coordinator drives fleet-wide L2 eviction by calling each MP server's"
" ``DELETE /l2`` endpoint, documented at :ref:`mp-http-l2-keys-api`."
msgstr "协调器通过调用每个 MP 服务器的 ``DELETE /l2`` 端点来驱动全队列的 L2 逐出，该端点的文档见 :ref:`mp-http-l2-keys-api`。"

#: ../../source/cli/coordinator.rst:117
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/mp/coordinator` for the coordinator's architecture, "
"registration protocol, and HTTP API."
msgstr "请参阅 :doc:`/mp/coordinator` 以了解协调器的架构、注册协议和 HTTP API。"

